NOTE ON THE DATA FILES

This licence covers the SOURCE CODE of this project. It does not, and cannot,
relicense the third-party reference data in `data/`, which carries the terms of
the bodies that published it:

  - UK DESNZ 2025 GHG Conversion Factors — Open Government Licence v3.0.
    Reuse requires the attribution line: "Contains public sector information
    licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0."
  - IPCC 2006 Guidelines Vol. 2 — cited excerpts only; no bulk redistribution
    without permission.
  - US EPA / US EIA — US federal government works, public domain.
  - EEA electricity intensity indicator — see the source entry for its terms.
  - NIST SP 811 / NIST WebBook — US federal government works.

Every figure names its source in `data/sources.json`, and the per-source terms
are documented in `docs/sources.md`. If you reuse the data, follow the source's
licence, not this one.
